lass=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Gerald R. Ford\">Gerald R. Ford</a> White House Photographic Office Series A0001-A9999 and B0001-B2886 photographs.</i> <br><br>\n</p>\nThe date on the photo contact sheet is the date the roll of film was processed, not necessarily the date the photographs were taken. See <a href=\"#Table\">table</a> below for additional details.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1975-03-02","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerald_R._Ford_Presidential_Library\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Gerald R. Ford Presidential Library\">Gerald R. Ford Presidential Library</a>, Image: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/A3499_NLGRF.jpg\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/A3499_NLGRF.jpg\">A3499_NLGRF.jpg</a> from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/19750302whpo.pdf\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/19750302whpo.pdf\">White House Photographs, March 2, 1975</a> of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/Library/whphotos/whpo.asp\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/Library/whphotos/whpo.asp\">White House Photographic Collection page</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:David_Hume_Kennerly\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:David Hume Kennerly\"><span title=\"American photographer (born 1947)\">David Hume Kennerly</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"This work is in the <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Public domain\">public domain</a></b> in the United States because it is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Copyright_status_of_work_by_the_U.S._government